  "content": "<center> \n\n![Potion_Recipes_Pixels_Reforged_Edition_Banner](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/518aa0f208675eac0ebb858d991f618d58f796c0_0.webp)\n\n\n**¡Hola! ~ 歡迎來到藥水配方：像素重鑄版！**\n\n有了這個資源包，你在製作自己的藥水時將獲得更多幫助，讓整個過程更輕鬆，並在隨時隨地釀造任何藥水時省下大量時間。\n\n所有你需要的協助，就在釀造台介面中！\n\n<br>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/b46eb6k-TWw\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<br>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/organization/pixelforge\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/32237a5eb0e69b0cfb6f79b09d08bafae2139664.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"> </a> <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/shadows_pixelforge\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6f8e5473c7cc891773d0963a204a7dbc0cae6ab8.png\" alt=\"Ko-fi\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"> </a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/QrU6QCFj5r\"> \n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ab1d9434d86f69f02be997775cc20d9f968fc6a6.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/shadowspixelforge\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fc15ed1de151999554a0a966e39ccaef439d6d4d.png\" alt=\"Twitch\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/shadowspixelforge\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2f10668a84476def0faf37c42319e0222484f94d.png\" alt=\"Instagram\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/shadowspixelforge\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b10f11429c9b97af2b45fcda64792d815fdeb5fb.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shadowspixelforge/projects\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6aa1b4a7d469617ce0e922b931c24e73ef48dc59.png\" alt=\"Curseforge\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3qlCr9lXguH44qq5xqAlzQ\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/74af846b0dabfde51cc50f295809ec96f63e26a2.png\" alt=\"Youtube\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"> </a> <a href=\"https://x.com/SPixelForge\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eb699f87a889d2710efc5dcff9b6b023b2be2d58.png\" alt=\"X\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"> </a>\n<br><br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b1fa1b92f81a2d74c2f8ca9d2d7b35ae7e200d54.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a2f227dd350f4e2322f500900863b7a6696b74f7.png\" alt=\"NO DEPENDENCIES REQUIRED\" width=\"660\" height=\"50\">\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n  **此資源包可完美搭配原版 Minecraft——無需額外模組。**\n\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b1fa1b92f81a2d74c2f8ca9d2d7b35ae7e200d54.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/16b6589f1f80535554e90efd303b5eb53deccc80.png\" alt=\"擁抱黑暗面\" width=\"550\" height=\"50\">\n<br>\n<br>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/potion-recipes-dark-mode-edition!\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d0593dc091108c8dd613ae3b553c4ff977094f5a_0.webp\" alt=\"Potion Recipes: Dark Mode\" width=\"700\" height=\"50\"> </a>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b1fa1b92f81a2d74c2f8ca9d2d7b35ae7e200d54.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c7f3b2837c699bc40bda584b7d5781389c4dbe3d.png\" alt=\"更多有趣專案\" width=\"690\" height=\"50\">\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellspacing=\"20\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/shadows-pixels-reforged\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/81c5b3f05c13dac83081221b58110365ada040c7_0.webp\" alt=\"Pixels Reforged Icon\" width=\"200\"></a><br>\n      Shadow's<br> Pixels Reforged!\n    </td>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/the-night-of-the-living-pumpkins\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/243c0c1904de2361e931432a6e0e5b0ee6b27e8f.png\" alt=\"TNotLP Icon\" width=\"200\"></a><br>\n      活屍南瓜之夜！<br>\n    </td>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/potion-recipes-vanilla-edition!\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5db9aeeeca92f223aeae14f2d48078dee1556f14.png\" alt=\"Potion Recipes: Vanilla Edition Icon\" width=\"200\"></a><br>\n      藥水配方：<br>原版版\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b1fa1b92f81a2d74c2f8ca9d2d7b35ae7e200d54.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5f88863218a1c549051bc37c2cbd07a395d1bdd2.png\" alt=\"你的支持至關重要\" width=\"850\" height=\"50\">\n<br>\n<br>\n如果你喜歡我製作的內容，別猶豫加入我的 Patreon 或 Ko-fi，享受所有會員專屬內容，你將能獲得許多額外內容，例如製作中進度、幕後花絮、開發部落格等等！\n<br>\n<br>\n<a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/shadows_pixelforge/tiers\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6dc8719629fd05f40aba4f4e58bc56458925abae.png\" alt=\"加入 ko-fi\" width=\"400\" height=\"50\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/shadowspixelforge/membership\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e73a4a0852508cb8d2b6a3dae2a42baef09334c0.png\" alt=\"加入 patreon\" width=\"400\" height=\"50\"> </a> \n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b1fa1b92f81a2d74c2f8ca9d2d7b35ae7e200d54.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fb424f5c7e4031e9d8691616a446883413c75421.png\" alt=\"常見問題\" width=\"155\" height=\"50\">\n\n</center>\n<br>\n<br>\n\n以下我為一些你可能會有的問題提供解答，希望對你有幫助。\n\n<details>\n  <summary>常見問題</summary>\n\n> **問：藥水配方：像素重鑄版是模組 / 模組包 / 資料包 / 插件……嗎？**\n> \n> 答：不是，這只是一個資源包！\n\n> **問：你能 / 你會製作基岩版移植版嗎？**\n> \n> 答：要製作能在基岩版上運作的版本，我需要學習基岩版的運作方式。所以這不是我短期內計劃要做的事情，但最終會實現。\n\n> **問：你現在 / 未來會製作模組嗎？**\n> \n> 答：目前我只製作資源包，但我不排除在不久的將來會製作與藥水配方相關的新內容。\n\n> **問：我可以把你的資源包放進我的模組包嗎？**\n> \n> 答：可以，只要你能給予我 credit 即可。\n\n\n</details>",
